    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iby'Umucunguzi w'Abisirayeli n'uw'ab'isi bose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 1.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nimunyumve mwa birwa mwe, namwe mahanga ari kure nimutege amatwi. Uwiteka yampamagaye ntaravuka, nkiri mu nda ya mama yanyise izina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 4.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 1.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akanwa kanjye yagahinduye nk'inkota ityaye, ampisha mu gicucu cy'ukuboko kwe kandi ampinduye umwambi usennye, mu kirimba cye ni mo andindira rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yarambwiye ati “Ni wowe mugaragu wanjye Isirayeli, uzampesha icyubahiro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ndavuga nti “Naruhijwe n'ubusa, amaboko yanjye yapfuye ubusa nyakoresha ibitagira umumaro. Icyakora nzacirwa urubanza n'Uwiteka, kandi Imana yanjye ni yo izangororera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero umva uko Uwiteka avuga, ari we wambumbiye mu nda ya mama ngo nzabe umugaragu we mugarurire Yakobo, Isirayeli amuteranirizweho. Kuko ndi uwo kubahwa mu maso y'Uwiteka kandi Imana yanjye imbereye imbaraga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.42.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 42.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 2.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyak 13.47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " aravuga ati “Kuba umugaragu wanjye ugakungura imiryango ya Yakobo, ukagarura Abisirayeli bacitse ku icumu, ibyo ntibihagije. Ahubwo nzaguha kuba umucyo wo kuvira amahanga, kugira ngo agakiza kanjye kagere ku mpera y'isi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibi ni ibyo Uwiteka, Umucunguzi wa Isirayeli, Uwera we abwira uwo abantu basuzugura, uwo ishyanga ryanga urunuka, ikiretwa cy'abatware ati “Abami bazabireba bahagurukane n'ibikomangoma baramye ku bw'Uwiteka ugira umurava, Uwera wa Isirayeli wagutoranije.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 6.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uwiteka aravuga ati “Igihe cyo kwemererwamo ndagushubije, no ku munsi wo gukirizwamo ndagutabaye, kandi nzagukiza ngutange ho isezerano ry'abantu kugira ngo uhagurutse igihugu, utume baragwa gakondo yabo yabaye umwirare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ubwire imbohe zisohoke, n'abari mu mwijima uti ‘Nimugaragare.’ Bazarishiriza ku mayira, no mu mpinga z'imisozi zose, ahari agasi hazaba urwuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.7.16+REV.7.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 7.16-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ntibazicwa n'inzara cyangwa inyota kandi icyokere ntikizabageraho, n'izuba ntirizabica kuko uwabagiriye imbabazi azabajya imbere, akabajyana ku masōko y'amazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imisozi yanjye yose nzayihindura inzira, kandi inzira zanjye za nyabagendwa zizuzuzwa zishyirwe hejuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore aba bazava kure, dore aba bazava ikasikazi n'iburengerazuba kandi aba na bo bazaturuka mu gihugu cy'i Sinimu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ririmba wa juru we, nawe wa si we unezerwe. Mwa misozi mwe, muturagare muririmbe kuko Uwiteka amaze abantu be umubabaro, kandi abantu barengana azabagiririra imbabazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Siyoni aravuga ati “Yehova yarantaye, Uwiteka aranyibagiwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mbese umugore yakwibagirwa umwana yonsa, ntababarire uwo yibyariye? Icyakora bo babasha kwibagirwa, ariko jye sinzakwibagirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore nguciye mu biganza byanjye nk'uca imanzi, kandi inkike zawe ziri imbere yanjye iteka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abana bawe barihuta, abakurimbuye n'abakugize amatongo bazakuvaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubura amaso yawe uraranganye urebe, bariya bose baraterana baza bagusanga. Ndahiye kubaho kwanjye yuko uzabambara bose nk'uwambaye iby'umurimbo, uzabakenyera use n'umugeni.” Ni ko Uwiteka avuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuko ubu ibikingi byawe byabaye indare n'umusaka, n'igihugu cyawe cyarimbutse, ni ukuri bizabera abaturage bawe imfungane, kandi abakumiraga bazaba kure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.19",
